    "reason": "Axes collapsed its seven axis members into three Axis records carrying options and the declared option, so the dump's entities.json spells state_default, sizes and size_default and variant_default where it spelled state_textures, size_models and size_scales. A size form is a sub-definition holding whichever of the two vanilla size mechanisms its subject uses, and every axis now carries an entry for the option its base row already is. The index holds the same meshes and the same selections in a different shape: 22 of the 24 artifacts captured held, every sweep among them, and the shipped tables are untouched so their digest never moved",
